  "rationale": "The three first-page questions and second-page mileage question update 2024 to 2025; the first-page footer adds Created 4/3/25 while the second-page heading updates its year. Reverse swaps the same page pixels and the prepended blank-page mutation shifts the same page pixels. The independently checked minimum-edit footer mask may retain the old year digit 4 by matching the 4 in the new date; this is a literal edit certificate, not a semantic edit description. The eight reused page images are byte-identical to the four directly viewed images. The newly prepended white pages contain no claimed changed glyph and are not used as source support."
